00:25:29,100 --> 00:25:29,620
You want to take it off?

288
00:25:30,180 --> 00:25:30,560
No way.

289
00:25:31,420 --> 00:25:32,020
Don't run.

290
00:25:32,820 --> 00:25:33,500
Don't want to take it off.

291
00:25:34,840 --> 00:25:35,440
What is it?

292
00:25:39,900 --> 00:25:40,800
Get out of the way.

293
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:44,120
Shen Qiang, come with me.

294
00:25:55,740 --> 00:25:56,140
Brother.

295
00:25:58,280 --> 00:25:59,300
You promised to help me.

296
00:26:00,140 --> 00:26:00,600
Guo Xiao.

297
00:26:01,860 --> 00:26:02,560
What's the point of living in this place?

298
00:26:07,540 --> 00:26:11,100
You gave your youth to a drug dealer.

299
00:26:12,320 --> 00:26:12,840
What else do you want?

300
00:26:17,960 --> 00:26:22,440
I didn't expect you to not only refuse to
help me, but also to teach me a lesson.

301
00:26:24,580 --> 00:26:26,080
Stop fighting with Zhang Jinming right
now.

302
00:26:26,380 --> 00:26:26,680
I can't.

303
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:28,560
You shouldn't have a grudge against him.

304
00:26:28,560 --> 00:26:30,140
This grudge is deeper than the sea.

305
00:26:30,900 --> 00:26:31,260
Why?

306
00:26:31,800 --> 00:26:32,320
What do you know?

307
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:33,840
Let me tell you.

308
00:26:34,320 --> 00:26:35,220
He grabbed my guest.

309
00:26:35,600 --> 00:26:36,220
He grabbed my Miss Hong.

310
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:38,100
This is not stealing my job.

311
00:26:38,340 --> 00:26:39,420
This is killing me.

312
00:26:53,410 --> 00:26:55,850
This guy is a real bastard.

313
00:26:56,590 --> 00:26:57,210
Guo Xiao.

314
00:26:57,690 --> 00:26:58,250
Don't persuade me.

315
00:27:00,050 --> 00:27:01,390
Boss, come out.

316
00:27:02,130 --> 00:27:02,650
Wait for me.

317
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:05,330
Don't go.

318
00:27:22,190 --> 00:27:22,770
Boss.

319
00:27:24,650 --> 00:27:28,330
I overheard your conversation just now.

320
00:27:30,030 --> 00:27:30,430
Yes.

321
00:27:31,070 --> 00:27:33,370
I almost got mad at him.

322
00:27:33,950 --> 00:27:35,490
Don't get mad.

323
00:27:35,830 --> 00:27:37,290
Don't get mad.

324
00:27:37,650 --> 00:27:39,070
Boss's advice.

325
00:27:39,670 --> 00:27:41,730
If you make a mistake, you make a mistake.

326
00:27:43,890 --> 00:27:49,750
Use Zhou's relationship with Zhang
Jinming's sister to bring his sister to

327
00:27:49,750 --> 00:27:50,670
our doorstep.

328
00:27:52,770 --> 00:27:56,330
This can not only make money, but also
avenge Zhang Jinming.

329
00:28:01,450 --> 00:28:06,530
At that time, I'm afraid that Zhou won't
come to us.

330
00:28:10,510 --> 00:28:11,210
That's great.

331
00:28:11,690 --> 00:28:12,310
That's great.

332
00:28:12,790 --> 00:28:13,970
Think about it right now.

333
00:28:15,670 --> 00:28:18,090
Remember, don't act rashly.

334
00:28:20,950 --> 00:28:21,970
I'm leaving.

335
00:28:21,970 --> 00:28:22,850
Wait a minute.

336
00:28:23,730 --> 00:28:25,210
No wonder you came to persuade me.

337
00:28:28,190 --> 00:28:30,910
Because you have fallen in love with Zhang
Jinming's sister.

338
00:28:34,790 --> 00:28:35,750
So what?

339
00:28:39,030 --> 00:28:41,430
If so, of course I should help you.

340
00:28:43,610 --> 00:28:46,450
And I shouldn't hate Zhang Jinming so
much.

341
00:28:47,530 --> 00:28:48,130
And?

342
00:28:52,030 --> 00:28:53,130
Brother, tell me.

343
00:28:53,690 --> 00:28:54,990
For you and his sister.

344
00:29:01,320 --> 00:29:02,090
All right, all right.

345
00:29:02,380 --> 00:29:03,040
You guys get off work early.

346
00:29:03,800 --> 00:29:04,740
Let me do this.

347
00:29:05,340 --> 00:29:06,320
You're usually the laziest.

348
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:07,400
Why did you change your mind today?

349
00:29:07,620 --> 00:29:09,760
I think there must be something strange.

350
00:29:09,940 --> 00:29:10,460
Don't talk nonsense.

351
00:29:12,090 --> 00:29:12,590
Jenny.

352
00:29:25,760 --> 00:29:26,600
Let's go first.

353
00:29:41,430 --> 00:29:42,210
You're early.

354
00:29:42,490 --> 00:29:43,530
I'm in a hurry to see you.

355
00:29:44,350 --> 00:29:45,570
How long have they been here?

356
00:29:46,550 --> 00:29:48,150
One day they will know.

357
00:29:49,530 --> 00:29:50,450
I'm going to pack up.

358
00:29:52,590 --> 00:29:53,490
Let me help you.

359
00:29:53,990 --> 00:29:54,410
Okay.

360
00:30:05,800 --> 00:30:07,380
I have good news for you.

361
00:30:08,180 --> 00:30:09,460
I have persuaded Gu Xiong.

362
00:30:10,500 --> 00:30:11,100
Really?

363
00:30:12,560 --> 00:30:15,660
He promised me not to worry about your
brother anymore.

364
00:30:18,100 --> 00:30:18,700
And...

365
00:30:19,860 --> 00:30:22,040
find a proper job.

366
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:23,860
Will he really listen to you?

367
00:30:24,980 --> 00:30:28,200
If our plan succeeds, how will you repay
me?

368
00:30:29,780 --> 00:30:30,720
I don't know.

369
00:30:33,520 --> 00:30:35,000
Let me make a condition, okay?

370
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:38,900
Marry me.

371
00:31:11,070 --> 00:31:12,490
We guessed it right.

372
00:31:12,490 --> 00:31:16,590
That guy named Zhou is deliberately
seducing Jenny.

373
00:31:16,990 --> 00:31:17,490
Yes.

374
00:31:17,870 --> 00:31:19,190
He appeared on Jenny's birthday night.

375
00:31:19,690 --> 00:31:21,190
He is Gu Xiong's mastermind.

376
00:31:21,750 --> 00:31:24,010
I think this conspiracy is not simple.

377
00:31:27,360 --> 00:31:28,280
This guy.

378
00:31:28,640 --> 00:31:29,640
Let me deal with him.

379
00:31:36,770 --> 00:31:38,270
You have a chance to revenge.

380
00:31:49,320 --> 00:31:50,260
Don't send it.

381
00:31:50,600 --> 00:31:51,280
I don't want to show it to my brother.

382
00:31:53,940 --> 00:31:55,400
I'll come to you on time tomorrow after
work.

383
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:56,680
Don't be late.

384
00:32:17,830 --> 00:32:18,990
I won't fight with you.

385
00:32:19,810 --> 00:32:21,710
But I won't let you go.

386
00:32:22,570 --> 00:32:23,590
There's nothing between you and me.

387
00:32:24,750 --> 00:32:27,590
If you dare to touch my girlfriend,
I'll give you a hard time.

388
00:32:27,590 --> 00:32:27,710
Go.

389
00:32:57,130 --> 00:32:59,930
Boy, this is a lesson for you.

390
00:33:01,170 --> 00:33:04,270
If you do it again, I'll teach you a
lesson next time.

391
00:33:04,790 --> 00:33:09,750
She is mine.

392
00:33:09,750 --> 00:33:12,510
If she is disloyal to me, I'll destroy
her.

393
00:33:13,190 --> 00:33:13,610
Go.

394
00:33:25,840 --> 00:33:26,380
You've changed.

395
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:27,020
You've changed.

396
00:33:27,540 --> 00:33:28,380
You don't listen to my advice.

397
00:33:28,600 --> 00:33:29,520
You don't listen to my words.

398
00:33:32,970 --> 00:33:33,990
I'm your brother.

399
00:33:34,310 --> 00:33:35,430
I'm your only family.

400
00:33:35,830 --> 00:33:37,190
You won't deny it, will you?

401
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:58,620
When I scolded Lin Si, she told me over
and over again to take good care of you.

402
00:33:59,120 --> 00:34:00,160
Take care of you.

403
00:34:01,840 --> 00:34:03,880
Don't follow her old ways.

404
00:34:07,740 --> 00:34:10,840
Today, I'm trying to make a living out of
a crime.

405
00:34:13,160 --> 00:34:17,840
But I've never let you get a little bit of
a crime on me.

406
00:34:24,480 --> 00:34:31,280
Now, you're in love with my enemy's
friend, a man who is a hooligan.

407
00:34:34,560 --> 00:34:35,000
I...

408
00:34:37,740 --> 00:34:38,620
I...

409
00:34:38,620 --> 00:34:40,720
I'm disappointed in you.

410
00:34:41,960 --> 00:34:42,600
I'm heartbroken.

411
00:34:45,540 --> 00:34:48,920
That's why I should love a man who is a
hooligan like you.

412
00:34:50,820 --> 00:34:52,420
I won't let you marry him.

413
00:34:53,220 --> 00:34:54,620
You've been trying to get him to marry me.

414
00:34:54,940 --> 00:34:56,120
You don't know my intentions.

415
00:34:57,280 --> 00:34:58,140
You're making excuses.

416
00:34:58,720 --> 00:34:59,660
I'm using him.

417
00:35:00,180 --> 00:35:03,160
Do you know he is my only master?

418
00:35:03,600 --> 00:35:04,620
I'm going to catch him.

419
00:35:04,980 --> 00:35:06,000
Stop arguing.

420
00:35:14,010 --> 00:35:16,610
You can't deny your brother's love for
you.

421
00:35:17,050 --> 00:35:18,590
Jenny, you should listen to him.

422
00:35:20,270 --> 00:35:26,600
I won't listen to him I'm glad I didn't go
to work tonight.

423
00:35:26,860 --> 00:35:28,160
Otherwise, you'd have to go to the
hospital.

424
00:35:28,980 --> 00:35:30,080
Thank you, Shirley.

425
00:35:35,600 --> 00:35:36,900
You were beaten like this.

426
00:35:37,080 --> 00:35:37,880
Why don't you call the police?

427
00:35:39,060 --> 00:35:40,840
Yes, I'll call the police for you.

428
00:35:41,520 --> 00:35:43,480
No, no, don't.

429
00:35:50,970 --> 00:35:52,050
What a fool.

430
00:35:52,730 --> 00:35:53,290
I know.

431
00:35:53,610 --> 00:35:55,030
I don't know what he's afraid of.

432
00:36:02,090 --> 00:36:02,690
Nothing.

433
00:36:04,170 --> 00:36:07,030
Because it's a misunderstanding.

434
00:36:11,280 --> 00:36:12,660
He hasn't come these days?

435
00:36:14,320 --> 00:36:15,340
No phone calls?

436
00:36:17,380 --> 00:36:17,980
No.

437
00:36:26,390 --> 00:36:27,250
Listen to me.

438
00:36:27,530 --> 00:36:28,450
Don't trust boys too much.

439
00:36:29,290 --> 00:36:30,210
I know.

440
00:36:30,790 --> 00:36:32,530
If he doesn't come to you, don't go to
him.

441
00:36:35,450 --> 00:36:37,470
But I have to go to him once.

442
00:36:51,850 --> 00:36:53,830
I didn't want to come to you again.

443
00:36:54,990 --> 00:36:57,350
But I want to tell you one last thing.

444
00:37:01,530 --> 00:37:03,250
You are a heartless person.

445
00:37:09,060 --> 00:37:11,040
Everything you said was a lie.

446
00:37:12,040 --> 00:37:14,120
Your attitude is no different from those
people.

447
00:37:20,110 --> 00:37:22,970
Don't think that because you don't come to
me, I'll be angry.

448
00:37:23,630 --> 00:37:24,970
I'm telling you, I won't.

449
00:37:25,890 --> 00:37:26,890
I'll never...

450
00:37:42,790 --> 00:37:44,290
You misunderstood him.

451
00:37:46,150 --> 00:37:50,210
After he sent you home that night,
he was beaten up by your brother's men.

452
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:57,380
Then he warned you not to be with him.

453
00:37:58,140 --> 00:37:59,640
Otherwise, it would be bad for you.

454
00:38:00,380 --> 00:38:04,060
So, for your safety, he didn't dare to go
to you again.

455
00:38:05,780 --> 00:38:08,100
Now you understand everything,
right?

456
00:38:20,680 --> 00:38:21,100
Zhiqiang!

457
00:38:22,580 --> 00:38:23,000
Zhiqiang!

458
00:39:16,740 --> 00:39:17,240
Zhiqiang!

459
00:39:24,300 --> 00:39:25,340
Zhen Ni!

460
00:39:26,720 --> 00:39:27,780
Zhen Ni!

461
00:39:28,960 --> 00:39:29,800
Zhiqiang!

462
00:40:06,150 --> 00:40:06,970
Don't worry.

463
00:40:07,530 --> 00:40:08,690
I will change Gu Xiong.

464
00:40:09,470 --> 00:40:10,950
You don't hate my brother?

465
00:40:11,530 --> 00:40:14,630
In order to achieve our goal, I will try
my best.

466
00:40:16,290 --> 00:40:18,150
Thank you, Zhiqiang.

467
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:45,880
How old are you?

468
00:40:46,440 --> 00:40:46,980
Seventeen.

469
00:40:48,180 --> 00:40:49,280
Very suitable.

470
00:40:50,020 --> 00:40:50,820
What do I do for a living?

471
00:40:51,540 --> 00:40:52,360
Very simple.

472
00:40:53,100 --> 00:40:54,420
In that little room.

473
00:41:00,960 --> 00:41:02,760
What do you do in that little room?

474
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:04,540
Go and take a look.

475
00:42:00,670 --> 00:42:02,690
How much is it a month?

476
00:42:03,270 --> 00:42:04,830
Don't say three thousand.

477
00:42:05,250 --> 00:42:09,610
If you become famous, six thousand is not
worth it.

478
00:42:15,020 --> 00:42:15,700
Six thousand?

479
00:42:16,680 --> 00:42:17,600
Six thousand?

480
00:42:18,700 --> 00:42:25,660
If you have money, you can buy new clothes
like Miss Qian Jin, wear high heels,

481
00:42:26,380 --> 00:42:30,780
use French perfume, live in a foreign
house, and drive a private car.

482
00:42:31,700 --> 00:42:35,520
Listen to me, I will teach you how to deal
with guests.

483
00:42:36,420 --> 00:42:40,080
If you do it well, I'm sure you'll be
famous in a month.

484
00:42:41,220 --> 00:42:41,620
Do you understand?

485
00:43:01,710 --> 00:43:03,790
Our business is getting better these days.

486
00:43:04,970 --> 00:43:07,210
I heard that girl is very good.

487
00:43:07,550 --> 00:43:09,270
She looks like a mischievous girl.

488
00:43:09,630 --> 00:43:10,990
She ran away from home last month.

489
00:43:15,600 --> 00:43:16,280
Jianmin.

490
00:43:16,760 --> 00:43:17,380
Yes.

491
00:43:18,580 --> 00:43:19,560
Do you have a way?

492
00:43:37,220 --> 00:43:38,060
Wait for you.

493
00:43:38,060 --> 00:43:38,980
Jianmin.

494
00:43:40,540 --> 00:43:42,280
Do you know any girls?

495
00:43:43,360 --> 00:43:43,960
Yes.

496
00:43:44,580 --> 00:43:44,980
Miss Xin.

497
00:43:45,840 --> 00:43:46,220
Shasha.

498
00:43:47,360 --> 00:43:48,820
She has a lot of workers.

499
00:43:50,120 --> 00:43:51,620
These guests are waiting for her.

500
00:43:57,980 --> 00:43:58,980
I'll bring it as soon as possible.

501
00:44:05,670 --> 00:44:06,570
Don't take it off.

502
00:44:09,660 --> 00:44:11,200
I want to talk to you first.

503
00:44:11,740 --> 00:44:12,260
Shasha.

504
00:44:12,820 --> 00:44:13,460
She's sitting on the stage.

505
00:44:13,680 --> 00:44:14,300
Please sit for a while.

506
00:44:15,520 --> 00:44:16,280
Sit inside.

507
00:44:17,400 --> 00:44:19,440
As long as you're willing, I'll double the
price.

508
00:44:20,320 --> 00:44:21,480
What about Mr. Zhao?

509
00:44:22,600 --> 00:44:23,420
Don't worry about him.

510
00:44:23,940 --> 00:44:24,980
You're not selling it to them anyway.

511
00:44:37,060 --> 00:44:37,680
How is it?

512
00:44:39,640 --> 00:44:40,940
I'm afraid they'll beat me.

513
00:44:41,260 --> 00:44:42,100
Don't worry.

514
00:44:42,680 --> 00:44:44,100
We have more people fighting than them.

515
00:44:45,720 --> 00:44:46,660
I'll order it for you first.

516
00:44:54,760 --> 00:44:56,540
Miss Lulu has a lot of guests.

517
00:44:56,540 --> 00:44:57,660
Why don't you do something else?

518
00:44:59,180 --> 00:45:00,440
We like her.

519
00:45:00,640 --> 00:45:02,900
She came to your house, so we followed her
here.

520
00:45:03,120 --> 00:45:03,960
I know.

521
00:45:04,240 --> 00:45:05,280
Please sit for a while.

522
00:45:05,800 --> 00:45:07,100
I'll bring it to you as soon as she comes
out.

523
00:45:07,220 --> 00:45:07,600
Okay.

524
00:45:09,280 --> 00:45:09,620
Lulu.

525
00:45:10,440 --> 00:45:11,160
Wait a minute.

526
00:45:15,670 --> 00:45:16,390
You're here.

527
00:45:17,650 --> 00:45:18,690
You're Shasha.

528
00:45:18,770 --> 00:45:19,790
This is Lulu.

529
00:45:20,090 --> 00:45:21,230
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

530
00:45:21,750 --> 00:45:22,430
Wait a minute.

531
00:45:22,530 --> 00:45:23,250
I'll be right back.

532
00:45:23,950 --> 00:45:24,950
Okay, I'll wait for you.

533
00:45:33,800 --> 00:45:36,940
We've found out that their Lulu is our
Shasha.

534
00:45:37,380 --> 00:45:38,340
That's outrageous.

535
00:45:39,160 --> 00:45:40,160
Gu Xiong.

536
00:45:40,260 --> 00:45:40,460
Yes.

537
00:45:44,360 --> 00:45:46,920
Shasha is our money tree.

538
00:45:47,060 --> 00:45:48,940
We have to get her back.

539
00:45:49,400 --> 00:45:52,100
Otherwise, don't come back to see me.

540
00:45:56,410 --> 00:45:56,970
Yes.

541
00:45:58,090 --> 00:45:58,730
Do it right now.

542
00:46:08,360 --> 00:46:09,340
What a joke.

543
00:46:10,900 --> 00:46:13,200
The little girl you introduced to me just
now has been taken away again.

544
00:46:13,340 --> 00:46:14,260
I didn't take her away.

545
00:46:14,540 --> 00:46:15,480
Then why did she have to leave?

546
00:46:15,740 --> 00:46:16,560
How do we know?

547
00:46:16,700 --> 00:46:17,400
It's none of my business.

548
00:46:17,480 --> 00:46:17,600
Say it.

549
00:46:19,120 --> 00:46:20,820
Whichever family gives more money,
just do it there.

550
00:46:21,660 --> 00:46:22,500
Do you understand the rules of the trade?

551
00:46:28,060 --> 00:46:30,080
Do you want another top guy?

552
00:46:34,010 --> 00:46:35,090
He lives in the apartment.

553
00:46:36,310 --> 00:46:37,750
We'll let him go when we've had enough.

554
00:46:38,610 --> 00:46:39,170
What do you think?

555
00:46:40,070 --> 00:46:40,990
You little bastard.

556
00:46:41,270 --> 00:46:41,670
Go, go, go.

557
00:46:42,270 --> 00:46:42,970
Damn it.

558
00:46:43,930 --> 00:46:44,110
Go.

559
00:46:53,980 --> 00:46:54,400
Hello.

560
00:46:54,400 --> 00:46:54,520
Hello.

561
00:46:56,500 --> 00:46:57,540
Gu Xiong.

562
00:46:59,180 --> 00:47:00,140
Are you free today?

563
00:47:00,780 --> 00:47:01,760
I want to meet you.

564
00:47:02,500 --> 00:47:03,440
I'm not free today.

565
00:47:03,720 --> 00:47:04,640
I have a holiday tomorrow.

566
00:47:05,160 --> 00:47:07,120
But I have a date with Jenny.

567
00:47:07,820 --> 00:47:08,680
That's even better.

568
00:47:09,260 --> 00:47:09,540
Xiao Zhou.

569
00:47:10,120 --> 00:47:14,160
Ever since you met Jenny, I haven't
invited you yet.

570
00:47:14,840 --> 00:47:15,400
So...

571
00:47:15,400 --> 00:47:15,900
All right, all right.

572
00:47:16,220 --> 00:47:16,880
I'm busy.

573
00:47:17,280 --> 00:47:18,620
See you in the old place tomorrow.

574
00:47:19,200 --> 00:47:19,520
Goodbye.

575
00:47:23,810 --> 00:47:25,090
You're welcome, Miss Zhang.

576
00:47:25,090 --> 00:47:26,990
Xiao Zhou is my brother.

577
00:47:27,670 --> 00:47:29,650
You're not strangers, of course.

578
00:47:30,670 --> 00:47:33,230
I heard about your relationship from
Zhiqiang.

579
00:47:35,210 --> 00:47:37,410
He's been with me since I was a kid.

580
00:47:38,010 --> 00:47:38,710
He eats when he's hungry.

581
00:47:39,470 --> 00:47:40,550
He talks when he's rich.

582
00:47:41,610 --> 00:47:42,730
That's right.

583
00:47:47,910 --> 00:47:48,930
Now...

584
00:47:48,930 --> 00:47:51,230
he's a decent man.

585
00:47:51,910 --> 00:47:53,390
I'm a big brother.

586
00:47:53,390 --> 00:47:53,630
But...

587
00:47:55,830 --> 00:47:56,650
I'm still wandering in the dark.

588
00:47:59,590 --> 00:48:00,850
Then why don't you learn from him?

589
00:48:01,530 --> 00:48:02,170
Learn from him?

590
00:48:02,750 --> 00:48:03,390
Yes, learn from him.

591
00:48:04,210 --> 00:48:07,190
From now on, I must find a right path.

592
00:48:08,410 --> 00:48:08,810
Brother.

593
00:48:09,390 --> 00:48:10,490
Thank you for your encouragement.

594
00:48:11,410 --> 00:48:12,210
Come on, have a drink.

595
00:48:17,920 --> 00:48:19,340
Have you been to the clothing store to see
him?

596
00:48:21,120 --> 00:48:22,420
Today is the holiday of the clothing
store.

597
00:48:22,740 --> 00:48:23,540
There's no one there.

598
00:48:25,140 --> 00:48:25,920
Where did he go?

599
00:48:28,200 --> 00:48:29,420
How would I know?

600
00:48:32,550 --> 00:48:33,590
Damn it.

601
00:48:34,390 --> 00:48:35,590
He's still with that kid.

602
00:48:48,200 --> 00:48:49,480
My brother...

603
00:48:49,480 --> 00:48:50,220
is the best at taking pictures.

604
00:48:51,620 --> 00:48:52,080
Come on.

605
00:48:52,480 --> 00:48:53,000
Take a picture for Miss Zhang.

606
00:48:53,960 --> 00:48:54,520
Xiao Zhou, come here.

607
00:48:54,740 --> 00:48:54,820
Okay.

608
00:49:16,420 --> 00:49:16,660
Brother.

609
00:49:21,020 --> 00:49:21,420
Look.

610
00:49:29,140 --> 00:49:29,600
Damn it.

611
00:49:29,820 --> 00:49:30,920
It's on the billboard at the door.

612
00:49:31,600 --> 00:49:32,880
It's your sister's picture.

613
00:49:33,040 --> 00:49:33,940
Her name is Li Li.

614
00:49:40,040 --> 00:49:40,720
Damn it.

615
00:49:41,420 --> 00:49:42,340
I'm going to smash his place.

616
00:49:42,880 --> 00:49:43,540
Don't move.

617
00:50:01,880 --> 00:50:02,740
How dare you!

618
00:50:02,820 --> 00:50:03,820
How dare you set up a trap for Qing Zhou.

619
00:50:04,300 --> 00:50:05,000
You betrayed him.

620
00:50:05,060 --> 00:50:05,920
What are you talking about?

621
00:50:06,120 --> 00:50:06,640
Let go of me.

622
00:50:06,740 --> 00:50:07,560
You let them take advantage of me.

623
00:50:07,720 --> 00:50:08,560
You let them take revenge on me.

624
00:50:08,760 --> 00:50:09,600
You totally humiliated me.

625
00:50:10,040 --> 00:50:10,800
What are you talking about?

626
00:50:11,340 --> 00:50:12,140
I'm telling you.

627
00:50:12,620 --> 00:50:13,760
You are not allowed to be with Qing Zhou.

628
00:50:14,620 --> 00:50:16,800
If I see you again, I'm going to beat you
to death.

629
00:50:17,540 --> 00:50:18,260
Listen to me.

630
00:50:19,000 --> 00:50:19,680
I have nothing to say.

631
00:50:19,900 --> 00:50:20,560
Listen to me.

632
00:50:21,120 --> 00:50:21,840
Listen to me.

633
00:50:23,080 --> 00:50:24,000
It's all a fact.

634
00:50:24,420 --> 00:50:25,220
What's there to explain?

635
00:50:25,440 --> 00:50:25,880
I won't listen.

636
00:50:26,100 --> 00:50:26,540
I won't listen.

637
00:50:45,430 --> 00:50:46,550
You are not allowed to be with Qing Zhou.

638
00:50:46,690 --> 00:50:47,250
Do you hear me?

639
00:50:47,810 --> 00:50:48,290
Do you hear me?

640
00:50:49,870 --> 00:50:50,590
Do you hear me?

641
00:50:52,370 --> 00:50:52,810
Jin

642
00:51:01,390 --> 00:51:01,570
Mi.

643
00:51:02,230 --> 00:51:03,110
Come here.

644
00:51:18,520 --> 00:51:19,980
Don't be sad, Zhen Ni.

645
00:51:20,620 --> 00:51:22,440
You can stay at my house for now.

646
00:51:23,160 --> 00:51:25,100
How can your brother be so unreasonable?

647
00:51:25,600 --> 00:51:26,340
He beat my sister.

648
00:51:27,080 --> 00:51:28,840
I've never seen such a man.

649
00:51:30,220 --> 00:51:31,480
I'll go to him right now.

650
00:51:31,540 --> 00:51:32,900
Ask him why he beat you.

651
00:51:33,320 --> 00:51:34,000
Don't go.

652
00:51:34,520 --> 00:51:35,360
I'm not afraid of him.

653
00:51:36,560 --> 00:51:37,660
You want to make trouble again?

654
00:51:38,500 --> 00:51:40,660
You promised me you wouldn't fight again.

655
00:51:41,440 --> 00:51:42,000
Did you forget?

656
00:51:43,920 --> 00:51:46,240
If I don't look for him, he will look for
me.

657
00:52:32,030 --> 00:52:33,790
Is my sister here?

658
00:52:34,110 --> 00:52:34,450
No.

659
00:52:34,830 --> 00:52:35,310
Where is she?

660
00:52:36,670 --> 00:52:37,750
She hasn't come to work for a few days.

661
00:52:38,690 --> 00:52:39,010
What?

662
00:52:39,550 --> 00:52:40,970
She hasn't come to work for a few days?

663
00:52:41,110 --> 00:52:41,510
Yes.

664
00:52:41,870 --> 00:52:43,110
Do you know where she is?

665
00:52:43,630 --> 00:52:44,790
I'm sorry, I don't know either.

666
00:52:45,730 --> 00:52:47,070
Okay, let's go.

667
00:53:34,670 --> 00:53:35,970
Which lady do you like?

668
00:53:37,170 --> 00:53:38,810
Is there a new lady here?

669
00:53:39,070 --> 00:53:39,410
Her name is Li Li.

670
00:53:39,710 --> 00:53:40,050
Yes.

671
00:53:40,050 --> 00:53:40,970
Please go inside.

672
00:53:52,220 --> 00:53:52,960
Please go inside.

673
00:53:53,500 --> 00:53:54,320
I'll call her right away.

674
00:54:31,330 --> 00:54:31,650
Let's go.

675
00:54:36,030 --> 00:54:37,170
My guess is right.

676
00:54:37,550 --> 00:54:39,110
These two guys are really here.

677
00:55:02,730 --> 00:55:03,290
Okay.

678
00:55:04,610 --> 00:55:05,770
This is my business.

679
00:55:07,150 --> 00:55:08,450
I'll take care of it.

680
00:55:10,290 --> 00:55:11,970
Jianmin, you can't go alone.

681
00:55:12,250 --> 00:55:13,010
Don't stop me.

682
00:55:14,590 --> 00:55:15,850
There is a tiger on the mountain.

683
00:55:16,310 --> 00:55:17,830
The direction is to the tiger's mountain.

684
00:55:21,310 --> 00:55:22,090
Don't move.

685
00:55:28,400 --> 00:55:30,040
Get out of my way.

686
00:55:44,450 --> 00:55:46,170
What can I do for you?

687
00:55:46,170 --> 00:55:47,290
I'm here to get some advice.

688
00:55:48,570 --> 00:55:51,230
Is it because of what happened to Zhang's
brother?

689
00:55:53,010 --> 00:55:54,810
No, it's a private matter.

690
00:55:56,390 --> 00:55:59,050
It's about my sister's disappearance.

691
00:56:01,670 --> 00:56:03,190
This is a private matter.

692
00:56:05,830 --> 00:56:07,190
We'd better talk outside.

693
00:56:08,190 --> 00:56:10,210
What time and place?

694
00:56:11,330 --> 00:56:12,350
Anywhere.

695
00:56:17,430 --> 00:56:20,450
At 12 o'clock in the evening, at the
restaurant in the suburb.

696
00:56:21,210 --> 00:56:22,850
Sit down.

697
00:56:23,910 --> 00:56:24,410
Sit down.

698
00:56:32,090 --> 00:56:36,390
Mr. Zhang, what can I do for you?

699
00:56:36,390 --> 00:56:37,190
Mr. Zhang.

700
00:56:39,370 --> 00:56:41,070
You are too good.

701
00:56:42,270 --> 00:56:47,090
If you dare to hurt him, I'll kill you.

702
00:56:49,150 --> 00:56:54,970
If you don't hand him over soon,
I'll die with you at any cost.

703
00:56:56,250 --> 00:56:57,970
Do you hear me?

704
00:56:59,310 --> 00:56:59,810
Do you hear me?

705
00:57:23,640 --> 00:57:25,460
Mr. Zhang, please.

706
00:57:37,660 --> 00:57:39,220
So what do we do now?

707
00:57:41,240 --> 00:57:44,360
As long as you hand over my sister,
you can do whatever you want.

708
00:57:53,150 --> 00:57:56,950
Why don't you hand over Lulu to our
company?

709
00:57:57,050 --> 00:57:59,830
In addition, I'll pay you 10,000 yuan as a
loss.

710
00:58:04,570 --> 00:58:05,250
What do you say?

711
00:58:06,830 --> 00:58:07,610
When do we make the deal?

712
00:58:08,510 --> 00:58:09,070
Anytime.

713
00:58:11,190 --> 00:58:13,510
At 10 o'clock in the evening, in the
suburb.

714
00:58:14,130 --> 00:58:15,250
It's a deal.

715
00:58:15,910 --> 00:58:19,450
10 o

716
00:58:25,600 --> 00:58:26,540
'clock.

717
00:58:26,540 --> 00:58:30,060
Zhao, if you have enough friends,
hand over Zhang's sister right away.

718
00:58:34,000 --> 00:58:34,460
What do you say?

719
00:58:44,250 --> 00:58:47,390
Mr. Gu, I really despise you.

720
00:58:47,890 --> 00:58:48,370
What do you think?

721
00:58:49,690 --> 00:58:53,010
Not only are you not kind, but you are
also very strict.

722
00:58:53,490 --> 00:58:54,190
What do you mean?

723
00:58:55,070 --> 00:58:57,590
Aren't you using Zhengyi as a sacrifice
now?

724
00:59:08,820 --> 00:59:09,570
I won't bother you.

725
00:59:17,510 --> 00:59:19,130
Are you making clothes?

726
00:59:19,690 --> 00:59:20,230
No.

727
00:59:21,130 --> 00:59:22,470
I want to know where Zhengyi is.

728
00:59:23,290 --> 00:59:24,050
We don't know.

729
00:59:24,430 --> 00:59:25,490
You must know.

730
00:59:30,540 --> 00:59:31,640
Please inform him right away.

731
00:59:32,720 --> 00:59:34,700
Call me before 10 o'clock tonight.

732
00:59:36,960 --> 00:59:38,940
Remember, don't make a mistake.

733
00:59:40,800 --> 00:59:41,120
Let's go.

734
01:00:01,900 --> 01:00:05,420
Zhengyi, Mr. Gu just came to the store to
see you.

735
01:00:06,740 --> 01:00:07,620
He came to see me?

736
01:00:08,240 --> 01:00:10,640
He asked you to call him before 10 o
'clock.

737
01:00:12,860 --> 01:00:14,720
Something must have happened.

738
01:00:22,060 --> 01:00:23,980
Why did he come to see me?

739
01:00:39,860 --> 01:00:42,900
Mr. Gu went to see you, so I guess Zhengyi
is with you.

740
01:00:58,480 --> 01:00:59,520
Don't worry about me.

741
01:01:00,160 --> 01:01:03,680
If I can't find you tonight, many people
will die.

742
01:01:04,120 --> 01:01:05,160
It has nothing to do with me if you want
to fight or kill.

743
01:01:06,200 --> 01:01:07,120
It has something to do with you.

744
01:01:07,720 --> 01:01:08,360
I don't care.

745
01:01:08,720 --> 01:01:09,340
You can't leave me alone.

746
01:01:10,340 --> 01:01:12,600
Zhengyi, you shouldn't hate your brother.

747
01:01:13,280 --> 01:01:14,380
You shouldn't run away from home.

748
01:01:15,080 --> 01:01:16,160
He can't hide it from you.

749
01:01:17,840 --> 01:01:19,840
No, he cares about you.

750
01:01:20,060 --> 01:01:21,900
He cares about your reputation and future.

751
01:01:24,180 --> 01:01:24,980
Do you know?

752
01:01:25,440 --> 01:01:27,100
That guy named Gu is framing you.

753
01:01:28,080 --> 01:01:31,320
He took your photo and made him deal with
your brother's conspiracy.

754
01:01:32,240 --> 01:01:35,240
He reported your photo and hung it at the
door of Jiulian.

755
01:01:35,700 --> 01:01:37,740
He called you the new Jiulian girl.

756
01:02:01,590 --> 01:02:03,830
I don't think Zhengyi will call us.

757
01:02:05,970 --> 01:02:09,150
If he doesn't come now, we will be
embarrassed.

758
01:02:19,620 --> 01:02:23,040
Gu took advantage of you and framed your
brother.

759
01:02:23,980 --> 01:02:26,300
And he made the situation worse.

760
01:02:30,490 --> 01:02:31,930
I'm going to find Gu.

761
01:02:32,890 --> 01:02:34,690
No, don't go.

762
01:02:35,330 --> 01:02:36,670
Why are you stopping me?

763
01:02:38,350 --> 01:02:38,810
It's no use.

764
01:02:45,470 --> 01:02:47,030
I will solve this problem.

765
01:03:00,510 --> 01:03:01,410
Is Gu here?

766
01:03:07,450 --> 01:03:08,390
They just left.

767
01:03:09,170 --> 01:03:10,510
They must have gone to the drying plant.

768
01:03:12,670 --> 01:03:13,470
I'll go to the guardhouse.

769
01:03:15,930 --> 01:03:17,950
Mary, go home with Zhengyi first.

770
01:03:23,430 --> 01:03:27,650
Zhengyi, as long as I'm there,
everything will be clear.

771
01:03:30,610 --> 01:03:33,610
From now on, your brother will know us.

772
01:05:20,140 --> 01:05:24,600
Brother Gu, I brought the money and people
you asked for.

773
01:05:56,620 --> 01:05:59,500
What about our brother Zhang's sister
Zhengyi?

774
01:06:04,800 --> 01:06:06,260
Oh, this thing.

775
01:06:12,920 --> 01:06:15,200
Brother Zhang's sister is not feeling
well.

776
01:06:15,300 --> 01:06:15,920
She is resting in a place.

777
01:06:15,920 --> 01:06:17,320
I will send her back in three days.

778
01:06:18,620 --> 01:06:19,340
What did you say?

779
01:06:19,840 --> 01:06:20,600
Say that again.

780
01:06:21,600 --> 01:06:22,760
Don't be so impatient.

781
01:06:23,920 --> 01:06:25,500
We are just out for a walk.

782
01:06:26,580 --> 01:06:27,980
Three days.

783
01:06:28,340 --> 01:06:29,160
Three days?

784
01:06:29,840 --> 01:06:31,480
You never keep your word.

785
01:06:35,000 --> 01:06:35,720
Get down.

786
01:06:50,480 --> 01:06:51,600
Get down.

787
01:06:55,390 --> 01:06:55,870
Get down.

788
01:06:55,870 --> 01:06:56,150
Don't hit him.

789
01:06:57,250 --> 01:06:58,150
Don't hit him.

790
01:06:58,890 --> 01:07:00,090
Listen to me.

791
01:07:00,390 --> 01:07:00,950
Don't hit him.

792
01:07:04,270 --> 01:07:04,550
Stop.

793
01:07:05,610 --> 01:07:06,590
You shouldn't hit him.

794
01:07:08,810 --> 01:07:09,710
Don't hit him.

795
01:07:09,930 --> 01:07:11,850
You should have killed him.

796
01:07:12,050 --> 01:07:13,890
Don't hit him.

797
01:07:14,290 --> 01:07:15,250
Don't hit him.

798
01:07:16,890 --> 01:07:17,830
You shouldn't have killed him.

799
01:07:17,830 --> 01:07:19,430
Let him go.

800
01:07:34,260 --> 01:07:35,560
Let him go.

801
01:07:40,020 --> 01:07:40,780
You murderer.

802
01:07:41,000 --> 01:07:41,740
You should have listened to me.

803
01:07:42,160 --> 01:07:43,190
You shouldn't have killed him.

804
01:08:14,880 --> 01:08:16,200
Go.

805
01:08:25,660 --> 01:08:25,880
Go.

806
01:08:27,980 --> 01:08:29,230
Go.

807
01:08:29,230 --> 01:08:29,420
Don't move.

808
01:08:30,380 --> 01:08:30,700
Don't move.

809
01:08:39,420 --> 01:08:39,980
Get in the car.

810
01:09:04,820 --> 01:09:05,620
Zhengyi.

811
01:09:08,390 --> 01:09:11,770
If only this wish could come true.

812
01:09:13,270 --> 01:09:15,690
How beautiful, how happy.

813
01:09:20,420 --> 01:09:23,100
And how free and comfortable.

814
01:09:24,380 --> 01:09:25,180
Mary.

815
01:09:29,580 --> 01:09:31,780
At that time, you married my brother.

816
01:09:32,320 --> 01:09:32,980
I married Zhiqiang.

817
01:09:32,980 --> 01:09:33,300
We got married.

818
01:09:33,920 --> 01:09:35,340
We had a good job.

819
01:09:35,580 --> 01:09:36,640
We lived together.

820
01:09:39,160 --> 01:09:39,680
Mary.

821
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:41,220
Don't you want to live like this?

822
01:09:44,320 --> 01:09:44,840
Mary.

823
01:09:45,440 --> 01:09:47,660
At that time, my brother was no longer
used by villains.

824
01:09:48,680 --> 01:09:50,260
He could raise his head and be a man.

825
01:09:50,780 --> 01:09:51,740
Be a real man.

826
01:10:01,100 --> 01:10:05,400
I'm afraid your brother will not be able
to enjoy those days.

827
01:10:10,270 --> 01:10:10,800
Shaofu.

828
01:10:10,800 --> 01:10:11,060
What happened?

829
01:10:13,600 --> 01:10:14,270
Jieming...

830
01:10:14,800 --> 01:10:15,560
Jieming...

831
01:10:15,560 --> 01:10:18,510
He was stabbed.

832
01:10:20,720 --> 01:10:21,590
