01:10:58,700 --> 01:10:59,240
I'm not lying.

847
01:10:59,690 --> 01:11:00,880
It's Zhu Zhiqiang.

848
01:11:01,560 --> 01:11:02,120
Zhu Zhiqiang.

849
01:11:12,560 --> 01:11:12,990
Mary.

850
01:11:13,410 --> 01:11:13,930
Mary.

851
01:11:15,490 --> 01:11:18,950
If my husband dies, you can't live.

852
01:11:25,770 --> 01:11:29,600
Come with me.

853
01:11:33,600 --> 01:11:34,670
Mary is right.

854
01:11:34,670 --> 01:11:38,170
If there's anything wrong with Jieming,
it's a murder.

855
01:12:31,880 --> 01:12:32,280
You...

856
01:12:33,540 --> 01:12:34,440
Why did you kill my brother?

857
01:12:34,600 --> 01:12:35,440
Why are you so heartless?

858
01:12:35,860 --> 01:12:36,620
Mary, listen to me.

859
01:12:36,640 --> 01:12:37,360
You said you were a guard.

860
01:12:37,580 --> 01:12:38,920
You said you stopped them from fighting.

861
01:12:39,080 --> 01:12:40,200
You lied to me.

862
01:12:40,300 --> 01:12:40,800
I'm not lying.

863
01:12:40,800 --> 01:12:41,480
You hurt my brother.

864
01:12:41,500 --> 01:12:41,840
Listen to me.

865
01:12:42,940 --> 01:12:43,560
You're lying.

866
01:12:43,960 --> 01:12:45,060
Listen to me, okay?

867
01:12:45,180 --> 01:12:45,840
You did everything to me.

868
01:12:46,420 --> 01:12:46,440
Yinglan.

869
01:12:46,900 --> 01:12:47,500
You're not human.

870
01:12:47,720 --> 01:12:48,560
You're not human.

871
01:12:48,720 --> 01:12:49,240
You're a murderer.

872
01:12:49,700 --> 01:12:50,100
Listen to me.

873
01:12:50,100 --> 01:12:50,980
Listen to me.

874
01:12:51,360 --> 01:12:52,700
I rushed to the scene.

875
01:12:53,060 --> 01:12:53,960
They were fighting.

876
01:12:54,200 --> 01:12:55,140
I rushed in front of them.

877
01:12:56,740 --> 01:12:58,320
I stopped them from fighting.

878
01:12:58,960 --> 01:13:00,500
But they were almost crazy.

879
01:13:00,880 --> 01:13:02,100
They couldn't hear me.

880
01:13:02,640 --> 01:13:04,400
I rushed over in a panic.

881
01:13:04,700 --> 01:13:05,920
I caught Gu Xiong.

882
01:13:06,480 --> 01:13:08,400
I told him about our plot.

883
01:13:08,600 --> 01:13:11,660
Just then, your brother stabbed him.

884
01:13:12,440 --> 01:13:14,520
I blamed your brother for not killing him.

885
01:13:15,120 --> 01:13:17,060
But they wouldn't let me go.

886
01:13:17,800 --> 01:13:20,840
In the end, your brother rushed over and
stabbed me.

887
01:13:24,980 --> 01:13:26,420
I didn't kill him on purpose.

888
01:13:27,040 --> 01:13:27,800
He rushed over.

889
01:13:28,300 --> 01:13:28,860
Do you understand?

890
01:13:29,700 --> 01:13:30,180
Do you understand?

891
01:14:07,980 --> 01:14:08,880
What should we do?

892
01:14:09,060 --> 01:14:10,480
Zhiqiang, what should we do now?

893
01:14:10,880 --> 01:14:11,520
I don't know.

894
01:14:11,860 --> 01:14:12,760
I don't know either.

895
01:14:13,200 --> 01:14:13,660
Zhiqiang.

896
01:14:14,320 --> 01:14:15,940
Zhenning, do you hate me?

897
01:14:16,300 --> 01:14:17,820
Will you ignore me from now on?

898
01:14:17,840 --> 01:14:18,680
No, I won't.

899
01:14:18,980 --> 01:14:19,680
I won't.

900
01:14:19,680 --> 01:14:19,860
I won't.

901
01:14:28,190 --> 01:14:28,880
Zhenning.

902
01:14:33,010 --> 01:14:33,700
Zhenning.

903
01:14:55,260 --> 01:14:57,040
I'll go buy some painkillers.

904
01:14:57,150 --> 01:14:57,920
I'll go with you.

905
01:15:05,080 --> 01:15:05,770
Zhenning.

906
01:15:19,840 --> 01:15:20,840
Hello.

907
01:15:20,840 --> 01:15:20,920
Hello.

908
01:15:27,050 --> 01:15:27,510
Okay.

909
01:15:28,890 --> 01:15:29,590
I'll be right there.

910
01:15:32,450 --> 01:15:33,230
My brother is bleeding.

911
01:15:35,310 --> 01:15:37,170
They wouldn't dare to send your brother to
the hospital.

912
01:15:37,370 --> 01:15:37,790
Yes.

913
01:15:37,950 --> 01:15:38,590
What should we do now?

914
01:15:38,990 --> 01:15:40,030
Go see him now.

915
01:15:40,410 --> 01:15:41,250
I'll go find the nurse in the same room.

916
01:15:46,560 --> 01:15:48,080
Zhenning, do me a favor.

917
01:15:48,240 --> 01:15:48,640
What is it?

918
01:15:48,900 --> 01:15:49,660
Go save a person.

919
01:16:16,980 --> 01:16:17,440
No.

920
01:16:19,800 --> 01:16:20,260
But...

921
01:16:21,180 --> 01:16:21,640
But...

922
01:16:22,340 --> 01:16:24,500
I won't blame Zhiqiang.

923
01:16:26,700 --> 01:16:31,760
I won't blame anyone.

924
01:16:35,170 --> 01:16:36,910
I deserve it.

925
01:16:39,050 --> 01:16:41,150
I deserve my retribution.

926
01:16:41,690 --> 01:16:43,370
Zhenning, calm down.

927
01:16:44,150 --> 01:16:45,390
Zhiqiang has gone to see the nurse.

928
01:16:56,740 --> 01:16:58,000
You son of a bitch.

929
01:16:58,560 --> 01:16:59,740
Just as we expected.

930
01:17:00,140 --> 01:17:01,300
Are you really going to save Zhang
Jianmin?

931
01:17:09,000 --> 01:17:11,180
Our brother just died under his knife.

932
01:17:11,960 --> 01:17:13,980
You are not only not worried, but you are
going to save him.

933
01:17:14,400 --> 01:17:15,280
Do you have the courage?

934
01:17:15,520 --> 01:17:16,500
I don't have time to waste with you.

935
01:17:17,220 --> 01:17:17,500
Let's go.

936
01:17:18,620 --> 01:17:19,060
Stop.

937
01:17:20,200 --> 01:17:21,080
It's not that easy.

938
01:17:21,800 --> 01:17:22,520
I'm telling you.

939
01:17:22,840 --> 01:17:24,020
Don't think we don't know.

940
01:17:24,920 --> 01:17:27,040
Brother Gu's death is a conspiracy between
you and Zhang Jianmin.

941
01:17:28,720 --> 01:17:30,220
Now I want you to pay with your life.

942
01:17:41,660 --> 01:17:41,980
Go.

943
01:17:42,000 --> 01:17:43,340
Xiaolian, Xiao Huo is hiding in the dark.

944
01:17:43,500 --> 01:17:43,920
You go alone.

945
01:18:13,080 --> 01:18:13,760
Don't blame me.

946
01:18:14,320 --> 01:18:15,720
I told you, murderers pay with their
lives.

947
01:18:20,590 --> 01:18:21,880
Xiao Huo, don't kill him.

948
01:18:21,880 --> 01:18:23,170
I beg you, don't kill him.

949
01:18:23,350 --> 01:18:24,010
Xiao Huo.

950
01:18:37,440 --> 01:18:38,020
Don't go.

951
01:18:38,640 --> 01:18:39,300
He can't live.

952
01:19:11,080 --> 01:19:11,700
Stop.

953
01:19:26,370 --> 01:19:26,990
Zhiqiang.

954
01:19:27,490 --> 01:19:27,850
Xiaolian.

955
01:19:29,290 --> 01:19:29,850
Xiaolian.

956
01:19:30,550 --> 01:19:31,710
Zhiqiang, I rushed to the warehouse.

957
01:19:32,030 --> 01:19:32,910
Zhang Jianmin is dead.

958
01:19:33,430 --> 01:19:34,050
Go.

959
01:19:34,430 --> 01:19:35,130
Shaofu is biting you with a gun.

960
01:19:37,070 --> 01:19:37,930
Where is Zhen Ni?

961
01:19:38,290 --> 01:19:39,970
He chased after him to stop Shaofu.

962
01:19:40,270 --> 01:19:41,530
But Ma Li is going to kill him.

963
01:19:43,770 --> 01:19:44,570
Zhen Ni.

964
01:20:27,300 --> 01:20:28,310
Zhen Ni.

965
01:20:29,120 --> 01:20:29,640
Zhiqiang.

966
01:20:47,490 --> 01:20:48,890
Zhiqiang.

967
01:20:52,190 --> 01:20:53,990
Zhiqiang Zhen Ni.

968
01:20:54,630 --> 01:20:55,230
Zhiqiang.

969
01:20:56,110 --> 01:20:57,470
Zhen Ni,

970
01:21:01,480 --> 01:21:01,760
Zhen Ni.

971
01:21:16,930 --> 01:21:17,630
Zhiqiang.

972
01:22:42,250 --> 01:22:46,670
So the devil's temptation will not stop.

973
01:22:47,610 --> 01:22:49,910
Can you get rid of his temptation?

974
01:22:50,850 --> 01:22:53,590
Can you see what is the path of light?

975
01:22:54,470 --> 01:22:56,230
What is the evil trap?

976
01:22:57,110 --> 01:23:01,270
This story is a mirror of reality.

